            },
            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Merz"
            },
            "reviewBody": "This was a wonderful way to boil crabs and get a rich flavor of the herbs in the crabmeat. Growing up eating Chesapeake style crabs, I must say this is a great alternative if you do not like bay seasoning. Using fresh herbs is key.",
            "datePublished": "2021-10-10T15:07:27.127Z"
          },
          {
            "@type": "Review",
